<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Jakobho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raJakobho</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakobho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba ridobva kuna</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAKOBHO</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba raJakobho ridonyohwa noumwe munhu waiitiwa Jakobho anogona kuva Jakobho munin'ina waJesu wanga ari mutungamiri mukherekhe yokuthanga ari umwe wovodare ropaJerusarema (Mabasa 15:13). Nhumwa Phauro anomudaidzawo kuti “bango” rokherekhe pana (vaGaratiya 2:9). Ana muzvinafundo vanotenda kuti tsamba raJakobho ridonyohwa kumakore yokumakumi mashano sure kwokuberekewa kwaKhirisitu. Sezvo Jakobho wanga ari mutungamiri wokherekhe muJerusarema, kabanga adonyora tsamba iri achiri kugara makaremo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rache Jakobho adorinyorera “ndudzi gumi nodziiri dzidopararira pakati pomarudzi” (Jakobho 1:1). Zvidzidzo zviri muna Jakobho zvinobata maKhirisitu vese asi kushandisiwa kwomashoko “ndudzi gumi nodziiri” zvinoita kunge Jakobho adonyora adonanga maKhirisitu vochiJudha. Nondava yokuti tsamba rakareri ridoitihwa kubata boka rikuru rovaverengi, rinomisoro yonyaya idowanda. Jakobho anonangana noukama huri pakati pokutenda nozviito. Kutenda kwochokwadi kunoonesewa nokuita (Jakobho 2:17). Anochenjedzawo pamusoro pokunangidza tsvete kuvapfumi (Jakobho 2:1-4) nokutiudza kuti tichenjerere zvatinonyaira (Jakobho 3:1-12)</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobho anomoresa vaverengi vache (Jakobho 1:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera anokurudzira maKhirisitu kutsungirira pakutambudzika (Jakobho 1:2-27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Wodzotaura makoshero yokuti kutenda kuti kunangidziwe nozviito (Jakobho 2:1-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pasure pozvakarezvo anotaura simba rinogona kuva mumashoko (Jakobho 3:1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobho anotsanangura zvino musiyaniro udoita uchenjeri hwaMwari nouchenjeri hwonyika (Jakobho 3:13—4:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera anoyambira vaverengi vache pamusoro pokuzvikudza (Jakobho 4:11—5:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobho anopedzisa tsamba rache nokupasa rairo dzidosiyanasiyana. (Jakobho 5:7-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Kubva kana Jakobho, muranda waMwari nowaIshe Jesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Kumarudzi gumi nomairi yadofararira pakati pomarudzi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Moroi.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda noUchenjeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Hama dzangu, mbondotii mufaro basi, pese pamunopinda mumiedzo idosiyanasiyana, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ndava munoziva kuti kuedzewa kwokutenda kwenyu kunozvara kutsungirira. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Kutsungirira kunofanira kupedza basa rakwene kuti muve mipurumira idokwana pasinai chamunosaya. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Kana panoumwe wenyu anosaya uchenjeri, mbaakumbire Mwari, anondopereka zvidotambanuka kuvanhu vese uye asingatsvage mhosva, achahupasiwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Asi mbaakumbire nokutenda asingatsakidze, ndava anotsakidza adoita kunge fungu rogungwa rinosundiwa nokupupurutsiwa nomhepo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Munhu wakareyo mbaareke kutarisira kuti achatambira chinhu kuna Ishe, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />munhu adodaroyo anomifungo miviri, anodekharikaba pazvese zvaanoita.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urombo noUpfumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Hama iri pasipasi mbaidade nokukwiridzihwa kwayene, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />nomupfumi mbaadade nokuderedzewa kwache, ndava achapfuruka kunge ruva romusango. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ndava zuva rinobirika nochithuthu charene rosvavisa usva, ruva rousvaho rinokuhumuka, kunaka kwarene kunoparara. Ndizvo zvichaita mupfumi achaumbuka ari pakati pokuita maronda yache.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuedzewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Adokomborehwa munhu anotsungirira pamuedzo, ndava kana wakunda pakuedzewa achatambira korona youpenyu idovimbisiwa naMwari kuno avo vanomuda. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Pakuedzewa, mbapareke kuva nomunhu anoti, “Ndiri kuedzewa naMwari,” Ndava Mwari anoedzewaba nozvidoipa, naiye pachake anoedzaba munhu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Asi munhu wese anoedzewa kana zvido zvache zvidoipa zvamukwezva nokumunyengedza. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Zvino kana chido chidoipa chabata, chinozvara chitadzo, chitadzo kana chakuritsa, chinozvara ipfa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Hama dzangu dzinodikana rekai kunyengedzewa. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Chidonaka chese nochipo chese chidokwana chinoburuka chichibva kudzuru, kuna Baba vozviedza vasingasanduke kunge mimvuri inonyedza. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Vadosarudza kutizvara kuburikidza noshoko rochokwadi, kuti tive chibereko chokuthanga chozvisikwa zvavo.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunzva noKuita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Hama dzangu dzinodikana, zivai zvinhu zvakarezvi. Munhu wese mbaakurumidze kunzva, achehwe kunyaira futi achehwe kukaripa, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />ndava ukari hwomunhu hunouyisaba kururama kunodiwa naMwari. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Saka bisai tsambwa dzese nokuipa kudowanda, nokuzvininipisa mutambire shoko ridotimbikiwa mamuri, rinogona kukuponesai.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Rekerai kuzvinyengedza nokundotetekera shoko basi, asi itai zvarinoreva. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Wese anotetekera shoko asi asingaite zvarinoreva adofanana nomunhu anoona chiso chache pachiringiriro, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />anoti kana wabva kuzvinangara, anoenda achibva wakangamwirafuti kuti adoita tini. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Asi munhu anonatsa kunangara mutemo udokwana unosunungura, kana akaramba achiita daro, asingakoshiwe zvaanzva, asi achizviita, acharopafadziwa panozvaanoita.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Uyo anozviona semunamati asi asingadzore chirimi chache, anozvinyengedza nokunamata kwacheko hakunai nokabonyo kese. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Kunamata kunotambihwa naMwari Baba sekudochena kusinai tsambwa nghuku, kuchengeta hungwa novajiche pakutambudzika kwavo nokuzvichengeta kubva pakusvipisiwa nonyika.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo pamusoro poTsvete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Hama dzangu, sevatendi muna Jesu Khirisitu Ishe wedu wokubhwinya, rekai kuva norusarura. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Tomboti paungano penyu pauya munhu adosimira mbacha dzidonaka nomhete yondarama, pouyawo murombo adosimira marengenya, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />kana mukanangidza kuremekedza kwopamusoro kumunhu adosimira zvidonaka momuti, “Garirai pamupando udonaka uyu,” asi moti kumurombo, “Mira apo,” kana kuti “Gara pasi pandidotsika,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />hamusi kusarurana nai, nokuva vatongi vano pfungwa dzidoipa?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Hama dzangu dzinodikana, tetekerai, anga Mwari haanai chere kusarudza vayevaye vanooneka nonyika kunge vadosauka kuti vave zvinoto pakutenda uye kuti vaje nhaka youmambo hwaadovimbisa ivo vanomuda? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Asi mudozvidza varombo. Anga vapfumi ndivoba nai vari kukudzvinyirirai? Ndivoba nai vari kukukakatirai kudare? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ndivoba nai vari kushora zita rinokudziwa ramudotenzewa?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Kana muchinatsa kuzazisa mutemo woumambo, maererano nogwaro rinoti, “Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita,” munoita zvidonaka. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Asi kana muchinangidza rusaruro, muri kuita chitema, mutemo unokukomwesai sevachori vomutemo. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ndava wese anochengeta mupurumira womutemo asi achiphonya pabodzi anomhosva yokuchora wese. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Nokuti uyo adoti, “Reka kuita upombwe,” ndiye adotiwo, “Reka kubaya.” Kana usingaite upombwe, asi uchibaya wava muchori womutemo. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Nyairai nokuita kunge vaye vachatongewa nomutemo unosunungura, <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />ndava mutongo usinai tsitsi uchanangidziwa kuno wese wanga asinai tsitsi. Tsitsi dzinokurira mutongo.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda noZviito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Zvinokabonyo kei, hama dzangu, kana munhu achiti ano kutenda asinai zviito? Kutenda kwacheko kungamuchidze nai? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Tomboti vatendi biyedu vasinai zvokusimira kana zvokuja zvopazuva nozuva, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />umwe wenyu akati kwavari, “Endai murugare, muthumihwe nokuja muchiguta,” pasinai zvaavaitira pakusaya kwavo, zvingave nokabonyo kei? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ndizvo zvidoita kutenda kwega kwega kusinai zviito, kudopfa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Asi umwe angati, “Uno kutenda, inini ndino zviito.” Ndinangidze kutenda kwako kusinai zviito, inini ndikunangidze kutenda kwangu kuburikidza nozvandinoita. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Iwewe unotenda kuti kuna Mwari mubodzi. Zvidonaka! Kana mashave yanotendawo zvakarezvo yachitogwagwadza nokucha. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Iwe dzemwa, unoda chere kunangidziwa kuti kutenda kusinai zviito hakunai kabonyo? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Anga baba wedu Abhurahamu adoitiwaba adorurama nondava yozvaadoita, paadopira mwanakomana wache Isaki paatari? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Waona kuti kutenda kwache nozviito zvaishanda pabodzi, uye kuti kutenda kwache kudokwanisiwa nozvaadoita. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Futi gwaro ridozazisiwa rinoti, “Abhurahamu adotenda Mwari, kwaari kuchibva kwanzi nghururama,” futi adobva waitiwa shamwari yaMwari. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Maona kuti munhu anoruramisiwa nozvaanoita aikona nokutenda kwegakwega.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nzvibodzibodzi kana naRahabhi pfambi, haanai nai kuitiwa adorurama nondava yozvaadoita paadotambira nhumwa achidzodziendesa noimwe nzira? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Sezvidoita muviri kana usinai mweya udopfa, nokutendawo kusinai zviito kudopfa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Chirimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Hama dzangu, rekai kuva vadzidzisi vadowanda, ndava munoziva kuti isisu tinodzidzisa tichanyanyitsa kutongewa. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Tese tinogwetsewa nomitoo idowanda. Kana munhu asingaphonye pakutaura, munhu wakareyo adokwana, anokonawo kuchengetedza muviri wache wese. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Patinoisa mathomu mumiromo yomabhiza kuti yatiteerere, tinokhonesa muviri wayene wese. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kana kutora muenzaniso wozvikepe, kana zvidotokura sei uye zvichisundiwa nomhepo inosimba, zvinokhomutsiwa nochidzoreso chidikidiki zvichienda kunodiwa nomuchairi. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ndomwenze chirimi nyhidikidiki pamuviri, asi chinozvikudza maninge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Fungai makuriro yosango rinopisiwa nokamoto kadikidiki! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kana nochirimi moto, inyika yozvidoipa pakati ponhengo dzomiviri yedu, chinosvipisa muviri wese womunhu, chinobatidza moto upenyu hwese, icho pachacho chinobatidziwa nomoto wogehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Marudzi yomhuka dzese, tushiri, zvinosvova nozvirombo zvomugungwa zvinogona kupingudziwa uye zvidombopingudziwa nomunhu, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />asi hapanai munhu anokwanisa kupingudza chirimi. Hachidekharike pakuipa, chidozara nonduru inobaya. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Nochirimi tinorumbidza Ishe naBaba, nacho tinotukana vanhu, vadosikiwa mumufananidzo waMwari. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Kubva mumuromo mubodzi bodziyo munobirika rumbidzo nokutukana. Hama dzangu izvozvo zvinofaniraba kudaro. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ko kasipiti kangabirike mvura idonaka noinochochora nai? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Hama dzangu, mukuyu ungabereke maorivhi, kana muzambiringa kubereka huyu? Nokasipiti komvura inochochora hakangabiritse mvura idonaka.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchenjera kunobva Kudzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Mbani adochenjera noanonzvitsitsa pakati penyu? Mbaazvinangidze noupenyu hwache hudonaka, nozviito zvinoitiwa mukupfava kunobva pauchenjeri. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Asi kana ukachengeta chanje inovava nokunyangarihwa mumwoyo mako, reka kuzvirumbidza nazvo nokubhwodokera chokwadi. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />“Uchenjeri” hudodaro hunobvaba kudenga asi ngwonyika, husiri hwomweya, ngwomashave. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ndava panousvinu nokunyangarihwa, ndipo pamunowana kunyongana nokuita kwese kudoipa. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Asi uchenjeri hunobva kudenga chokuthanga hudochena, hunofarira runyararo, hudopfava, hunozvideredza, huzere notsitsi nochibereko chidonaka, hahunai rusaruro hahusi hwomusese. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Vayananisi vanojara murunyararo vanokohwa goho rokururama.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Kusava noUshamwari noNyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Chii chinokonzera hondo, chii chinokonzera botso pakati penyu? Zvinobvaba pazvido zvenyu zvinohwisana mukati menyu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Munoda chinhu asi hamuchiwane, saka munobaya. Futi munochiva asi hamuwane zvamunoda saka munoita botso nokumutsa hondo, futi hapanai chamunacho, ndava munokumbiraba Mwari. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Pamunokumbira hamutambire, ndava hamukumbirire buya, kundoda kuzvifadza nazvo. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Imi mhombo dzovanhu, munozivaba nai kuti ushamwari nonyika kuita mhandu yaMwari? Saka wese anoda kuva shamwari yonyika anozviita muvengi waMwari. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Kana kuti munofunga kuti gwaro rinotaura mahara kuti Mwari anotipfira noshungu nokuda kwomweya waadogarisa matiri? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Asi anopasa mutsa dzidowanda. Ndokusaka gwaro richiti, “Mwari anopikisana novanozvikudza, asi anopasa mutsa anozvininipisa.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Zviisei ndipo pasi paMwari. Dzivisai jabhurosi, kuti akutizei. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Nyedzai papfupi naMwari iye achanyedzawo kwamuri. Shambai manja yenyu, imi vatadzi, chenesai mwoyo yenyu, imi vomufungo miviri. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Dodomai zviso, rirai muite maundu, musandure kuseka kwenyu kuve kurira nokufara kwenyu kuve kudodoma kwozviso. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Zvininipisei pamberi paIshe, iye achakukwiridzirai.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo pamusoro poKutongana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Hama, rekai kumbonyaira zvokunyangadzirana. Wese anonyaira achinyangadzira hama yache kana kumutonga, anotaura achinyangadzira mutemo nokuutonga. Kana uchitonga mutemo, hausi kuuchengeta, asi watova mutongi wawene. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Panondova noMupi womutemo mubodzi nomutongi, ndiye anogona kuponesa nokuparadza. Asi iwepa ndiwe yani kuti utonge mabiyako?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo Pamusoro Pokuzvikudza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Manje tetekerai vakaremi munoti, “Nasi kana mangwana tichaenda kuguta rakati, toita gore tiri kwakareko, tichiita maronda nokuwana mari.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Apa munozivaba zvichaitika mangwana. Upenyu hwenyu chiiko? Muri mhute inooneka nguwa ipfupipfupi yonyangarika. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Maitofanira kuti, “Kana kuri kuda kwaIshe, tikararama tichaita chokuti nochokuti.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Asi manje munozvikudza nokuzvipembedza. Kuzvikudza kwakareko kwese kudoipa.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Uyo wese anoziva zvidonaka zvaanofanira kuita akareka kuzviita, nyhitema kwaari.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo kuVapfumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Zvino tetekerai imipa vapfumi, rirai muite maundu nondava yokutambudzika kuri kuuya kwamuri. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Pfuma yenyu yaora, tukumo taja mbacha dzenyu. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ndarama yenyu nosirivha yenyu zvaita ngura. Ngura yazvene ichakurovererai nokuparadza nyama yenyu kunge moto. Mudotutira pfuma pamazuva yokupedzisira. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Onai! Mihoro yamudotadzirira kuripa vashandi vaichekerera minda yenyu iri kudaidzira. Kudaidzira kwovakohwi kwasvika munzeve dzaIshe wohondo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mudogara panyika muri paufuru mudogarika. Mudozvikodza mwoyo pazuva rokubaya. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mudotongera runya mudobaya munhu adorurama, wanga asingakudzivisei.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsungirira noMunamato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Hama tsungirirai, kusvikira pakuuya kwaIshe. Nangarai murimi anomirira munda kuti uberekese zvirimwa zvinokosha nokutsungirira kwaanoita kusvikira zvawana mvura yokuthanga noyokupedzisira. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Nemiwo, tsungai mudomira zvidosimba, ndava kuuya kwaIshe kwava papfupi.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Hama rekai kunyunyutirana, kuti mureke kutongwa. Mutongi adomira pamusuwo! <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Hama, pakutsungirira pamatambudziko torai muenzaniso wovaporofiti vaitaura muzita raIshe. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Onai, tinototi vadokomborehwa ivo vadotsungirira. Mudonzva kutsungirira kwaJobho uye pakupedzisira mudoona zvidodzoitiwa naIshe. Ishe vazere notsitsi noruyamuro.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Hama dzangu, pamusoro pozvese, rekai kupika kana nodenga kana nonyika kana nokumwe kupika. Asi itai “Inde” panodiwa inde, moti “Neye” panodiwa “neye” kuti mureke kuwira mukutongewa.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Panoumwe ari kutambudzika chere pakati penyu? Mbaanamate. Pano ari kufara chere? Mbaaimbe zvimbo zvokurumbidza. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Pano anohwara chere pakati penyu? Mbaadaidze vakuru vokherekhe kuti vamunamatire vamuzore nomafuta muzita raIshe. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Munamato unopasiwa nokutenda uchaporesa muhwere, Ishe vachamumutsa. Kana adoita zvitema, acharegerehwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Saka reuriranai zvitema zvenyu, munamatirane kuti muporesewe. Munamato womunhu adorurama unosimba rikuru pakubata kwawene. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eriya wanga ari munhu kunge isisu. Adonamata zvidonyanya kuti mvura ireke kuna, ichibva yarekera kuna panyika kwomakore matatu nomwedzi mitanhatu. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Adonamata kamu, denga richibva ranisa mvura, nyika ichibva yabereka zvibereko zvayene.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Hama dzangu, kana umwe wenyu akatsambuka kubva pachokwadi pachidzoita anomudzora, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mbaazive kuti wese anodzora mutadzi panzira yokudzonga kwache achamuponesa paipfa nokusvisva zvitema zvizinji.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>